OL,3,GNEWSAShop staff key to reducing knife  
OL,4,Acrime, says owner                      
OL,6,FShop staff have been reminded to       
OL,7,Fchallenge the ages of young people     
OL,8,Fbuying knives.                         
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police cadets have  
OL,11,Fbeen trying to buy sharp items in      
OL,12,FBarnstaple as part of Operation        
OL,13,FSceptre, a national police initiative  
OL,14,Faimed at reducing knife crime.         
OL,16,FIn May, they carried out 27 test       
OL,17,Fpurchases of knives at different shops,
OL,18,Ftwo of which failed the test by not    
OL,19,Fasking for or checking identification  
OL,20,Fto prove the cadets were 18 years old  
OL,21,For older.                              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
